  "boundary": "The common loopback wrapper validates the outer deterministic request before unshare. An explicitly delegated inner acceptance launcher holds a fresh POSIX lock for the lifetime of the child. Both namespaces and the UID map are recorded; normal real mode acquires no test scope; invalid outer requests are rejected before unshare.",
